  "question": {
    "text": "When Ethane-1,2-diamine is added progressively to an aqueous solution of Nickel (II) chloride, the sequence of colour change observed will be :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "nNMNZ",
      "text": "Violet $\\rightarrow$ Blue $\\rightarrow$ Pale Blue $\\rightarrow$ Green",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "8wOfp",
      "text": "Pale Blue $\\rightarrow$ Blue $\\rightarrow$ Green $\\rightarrow$ Violet",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dqRbO",
      "text": "Green $\\rightarrow$ Pale Blue $\\rightarrow$ Blue $\\rightarrow$ Violet",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "IwqwM",
      "text": "Pale Blue $\\rightarrow$ Blue $\\rightarrow$ Violet $\\rightarrow$ Green",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_6\\right]_{(\\mathrm{aq})}^{+2}+\\mathrm{en}_{(\\mathrm{aq})} \\rightarrow\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_4(\\mathrm{en})\\right]_{(\\mathrm{aq})}^{+2}+2 \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}$\n\nGreen\n$\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_4(\\mathrm{en})\\right]_{(\\mathrm{aq})}^{+2}+\\mathrm{en}_{(\\mathrm{aq})} \\rightarrow\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_2(\\mathrm{en})_2\\right]_{(\\mathrm{aq})}^{+2}+2 \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}$\n\nPale Blue\n$\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_2(\\mathrm{en})\\right]_{(\\mathrm{aq})}^{+2}+\\mathrm{en}_{(\\mathrm{aq})} \\rightarrow\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}(\\mathrm{en})_3\\right]_{(\\mathrm{aq})}^{+2}+2 \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}$\n\nBlue / purple",
    "image": null
  },
